WEBVTT

01:38.229 --> 01:41.050
[The Demon Hunter's Romance]

01:41.080 --> 01:43.990
[Episode 23]

02:02.450 --> 02:04.680
Shoot arrows at him!

02:25.079 --> 02:26.910
Don't let him escape!

02:30.960 --> 02:32.690
They're bullying Big Brother!

02:32.840 --> 02:33.750
Third Brother, Fourth Brother,

02:33.750 --> 02:34.810
grab your weapons!

02:35.150 --> 02:36.500
Grab your weapons!

02:52.400 --> 02:53.750
Where did these scoundrels come from?

02:53.750 --> 02:54.800
Everyone, stop!

03:15.000 --> 03:18.030
Come beat him up!

03:18.110 --> 03:19.550
I'll fight you!

03:33.750 --> 03:35.240
Who sent you?

03:35.690 --> 03:37.560
Why are you trying to assassinate me?

03:37.560 --> 03:39.250
I won't tell you.

03:45.329 --> 03:46.660
Come here if you dare!

03:58.490 --> 03:59.690
I'll ram you to death!

04:02.870 --> 04:04.580
How dare you meddle in our affairs!

04:04.580 --> 04:07.270
You bastard!

04:41.070 --> 04:42.870
Seize him!

04:46.510 --> 04:47.630
I'll kill you with one punch!

04:47.630 --> 04:48.600
I'll kill you with two punches!

04:48.600 --> 04:49.480
I'll kill you with three punches!

04:49.480 --> 04:50.510
I'll kill you with four punches!

04:50.510 --> 04:51.310
Five punches—

04:56.610 --> 04:58.450
You have no honor in combat!

04:59.159 --> 04:59.830
Die!

05:11.240 --> 05:11.870
Stop!

05:21.310 --> 05:23.160
Quick, go home! Go home!

05:29.390 --> 05:30.920
My Lord, you look familiar.

05:31.310 --> 05:32.870
May I ask who you are, My Lord?

05:32.870 --> 05:35.070
We are from the Court of Judicial Review.

05:35.070 --> 05:36.860
This is a traitor to the country.

05:36.860 --> 05:38.920
We are here on imperial orders to investigate.

05:38.920 --> 05:40.720
If he's a traitor to the country,

05:40.800 --> 05:42.600
why not capture and interrogate him?

05:42.600 --> 05:44.730
How can you kill someone in the street?

05:46.140 --> 05:47.540
By the Emperor's decree,

05:47.680 --> 05:49.800
we can kill as we please.

05:49.940 --> 05:52.340
Do we need to explain ourselves to you?

05:52.480 --> 05:54.740
I am the county commandant of Guangping.

05:54.870 --> 05:56.830
This is Guangping's jurisdiction.

05:56.830 --> 05:59.090
How can I allow you to kill in the streets?

06:02.160 --> 06:04.350
Oh, the county commandant of Guangping?

06:04.350 --> 06:05.450
Such a high-ranking official!

06:05.450 --> 06:06.910
You've scared us to death!

06:11.360 --> 06:12.560
I think you're a

06:12.870 --> 06:15.000
soon-to-be-dead county commandant.

06:35.340 --> 06:37.690
It's not honorable to win like this.

06:43.470 --> 06:46.159
Take this great county commandant away.

06:46.310 --> 06:47.040
-Yes.
-Yes.

07:44.190 --> 07:45.120
Why are you here?

07:46.430 --> 07:47.960
I have something to ask you.

07:50.750 --> 07:52.070
Do we know each other?

07:53.920 --> 07:54.430
Yes.

07:55.240 --> 07:56.300
We know each other.

07:57.240 --> 07:57.870
We moon-gazed together

07:57.870 --> 07:59.120
on the hillside

07:59.830 --> 08:00.760
of Nanyang City.

08:06.160 --> 08:07.620
Have you seen this person?

08:07.680 --> 08:08.540
Never seen him.

08:16.270 --> 08:17.950
Now I want to see

08:17.970 --> 08:20.280
if you'll die or not.

08:20.870 --> 08:21.680
This is outrageous!

08:21.680 --> 08:23.360
It's infuriating! Meddling in others' affairs!

08:23.360 --> 08:24.950
This is absolutely outrageous!

08:24.950 --> 08:26.190
It's truly outrageous!

08:26.190 --> 08:27.160
I'm furious!

08:27.180 --> 08:28.430
I want to see if you'll die or not.

08:28.430 --> 08:29.070
I'm going to kill you.

08:29.070 --> 08:29.690
Kill you.

08:29.720 --> 08:31.120
I must kill you.

08:35.030 --> 08:36.080
This scoundrel!

08:36.440 --> 08:37.600
I want to see

08:38.100 --> 08:39.860
how long you can hold out for.

08:40.270 --> 08:41.059
Are you faster at running

08:41.059 --> 08:42.460
or am I faster at drawing?

08:47.550 --> 08:48.240
Coming!

08:54.240 --> 08:56.320
May I help you?

08:57.600 --> 08:59.860
I need some ink and brushes. It's urgent.

08:59.930 --> 09:01.460
The shop is already closed.

09:01.460 --> 09:03.050
Please try somewhere else.

09:19.720 --> 09:20.720
Where is Youhuang?

09:20.720 --> 09:21.200
Who?

09:26.200 --> 09:27.240
How did you wake me up?

09:27.240 --> 09:28.100
What did you do?

09:28.390 --> 09:30.000
There's no time to explain now.

09:30.000 --> 09:31.390
We don't have much time left.

09:31.390 --> 09:32.650
Where are we going now?

09:38.200 --> 09:39.000
They've woken up.

09:39.000 --> 09:39.670
You need to leave quickly.

09:39.670 --> 09:40.730
I'll hold them off.

09:44.390 --> 09:45.320
Be careful then.

09:45.460 --> 09:46.200
After I'm done,

09:46.200 --> 09:47.530
where should I find you?

09:47.870 --> 09:48.440
My home.

09:48.630 --> 09:49.560
Ganshan Clinic?

09:49.630 --> 09:50.120
No.

09:50.600 --> 09:51.460
Simao's house.

09:52.840 --> 09:53.500
Go quickly.

10:13.410 --> 10:13.940
Brother.

10:13.990 --> 10:16.490
You're... you're back.

10:30.040 --> 10:31.070
You're smarter

10:31.100 --> 10:32.150
than I imagined.

10:32.720 --> 10:33.920
Truly worthy of being

10:35.150 --> 10:36.080
the Big Brother.

10:37.480 --> 10:38.150
How dare I have

10:38.150 --> 10:39.680
a younger brother like you?

10:40.840 --> 10:41.670
Why?

10:43.080 --> 10:44.680
Older and younger brothers,

10:44.710 --> 10:47.040
rulers and subjects, fathers and sons...

10:47.240 --> 10:48.440
all so affectionate.

10:51.480 --> 10:52.510
How interesting.

10:55.790 --> 10:57.250
When did you figure me out?

10:59.720 --> 11:00.320
Long ago.

11:02.600 --> 11:03.530
I didn't expect you

11:03.530 --> 11:05.390
to be an even better actor than me.

11:06.010 --> 11:07.680
Where did I slip up?

11:10.000 --> 11:11.260
The master of this place

11:11.260 --> 11:12.220
created such a

11:12.240 --> 11:13.480
lifelike world.

11:14.080 --> 11:14.630
How could they possibly

11:14.630 --> 11:16.560
just be watching from the outside?

11:19.440 --> 11:20.440
That makes sense.

11:23.510 --> 11:24.600
When I was young,

11:24.910 --> 11:25.840
my father told me

11:27.480 --> 11:28.840
that in this world,

11:29.000 --> 11:30.550
there are powerful demons

11:31.030 --> 11:33.430
that can create very realistic illusions.

11:33.670 --> 11:35.150
I didn't believe it at first.

11:35.150 --> 11:36.810
I always thought he was lying.

11:37.700 --> 11:39.300
I didn't expect it to be true.

11:39.910 --> 11:41.080
It's just a pity.

11:42.030 --> 11:43.550
It's a pity that your companion demon

11:43.550 --> 11:45.080
is so weak in magical power.

11:45.640 --> 11:46.360
It's not even

11:46.360 --> 11:47.760
a match for my bare hands.

11:48.550 --> 11:50.880
If I hadn't been pulled into the painting,

11:51.030 --> 11:52.100
I could've easily

11:52.450 --> 11:53.480
taken his life on the spot

11:53.480 --> 11:54.680
that day in the study.

11:55.120 --> 11:56.080
How could a demon

11:56.790 --> 11:57.390
like that possibly be

11:57.390 --> 11:58.990
the master of this painting?

11:59.480 --> 12:00.440
So I concluded

12:01.240 --> 12:02.670
that the mastermind behind this

12:02.670 --> 12:03.870
must be someone else.

12:06.150 --> 12:07.280
I also discovered

12:08.480 --> 12:09.440
that as long as I didn't change

12:09.440 --> 12:10.640
my words and actions,

12:11.510 --> 12:12.630
the others wouldn't change.

12:12.630 --> 12:13.480
Only you

12:14.670 --> 12:15.800
would be different.

12:25.360 --> 12:26.090
Big Brother.

12:26.320 --> 12:27.120
Are you hurt?

12:27.870 --> 12:28.840
What are you waiting for?

12:28.840 --> 12:30.360
Help Big Brother up.

12:31.080 --> 12:31.440
Okay.

12:39.820 --> 12:40.680
What happened?

12:41.550 --> 12:42.480
Why are you here?

12:42.910 --> 12:45.200
Big Brother, are you alright?

12:49.910 --> 12:50.640
Big Brother.

12:50.840 --> 12:51.750
Are you hurt?

12:52.800 --> 12:53.480
What are you waiting for?

12:53.480 --> 12:55.120
Help Big Brother up.

13:01.560 --> 13:02.420
What happened?

13:03.910 --> 13:04.840
Why are you here?

13:04.910 --> 13:07.670
We were talking about going to work.

13:10.960 --> 13:12.420
Impressive, impressive.

13:13.080 --> 13:13.810
I admire you.

13:17.870 --> 13:19.670
We've been fighting for so long,

13:19.790 --> 13:21.590
yet I still don't know your name.

13:22.120 --> 13:23.390
I go by a single name:

13:23.870 --> 13:25.030
Mirage.

13:25.750 --> 13:26.360
Mirage?

13:28.870 --> 13:29.750
Good name.

13:30.710 --> 13:31.710
It suits you well.

13:33.980 --> 13:34.720
It's been a long time since anyone

13:34.720 --> 13:36.120
has made me this happy.

13:37.390 --> 13:39.430
I am an ancient divine beast,

13:39.750 --> 13:42.610
blessed with intelligence by the forces of nature.

13:42.750 --> 13:43.960
There are countless demons who have

13:43.960 --> 13:45.690
awakened their intelligence.

13:45.870 --> 13:47.150
However, whether one can attain

13:47.150 --> 13:48.240
the way of immortality

13:48.240 --> 13:49.770
depends solely on oneself.

13:50.320 --> 13:51.720
I refused to be mediocre.

13:52.250 --> 13:54.120
I meditated by the abyss for a thousand years

13:54.120 --> 13:56.720
to finally achieve this level of cultivation.

13:57.600 --> 13:58.320
One day,

13:59.630 --> 14:01.200
I arrived in Guangping.

14:04.790 --> 14:06.520
Guangping is truly beautiful.

14:06.720 --> 14:08.870
I was so engrossed in cultivation before

14:08.870 --> 14:10.120
that I didn't even know

14:10.120 --> 14:10.750
there was

14:10.750 --> 14:12.810
such a wonderful place in this world.

14:13.200 --> 14:16.030
In this vast universe, the mortal world is boundless.

14:16.030 --> 14:17.890
The joys and sorrows of human life

14:18.270 --> 14:19.670
are truly fascinating.

14:25.920 --> 14:27.720
Have you ever eaten candied haw?

14:29.510 --> 14:30.480
I have.

14:31.080 --> 14:32.790
I ate it in Guangping.

14:33.750 --> 14:34.600
The taste

14:35.550 --> 14:36.750
was truly wonderful.

14:37.120 --> 14:38.750
Sweet with a hint of sourness.

14:38.750 --> 14:39.600
When you bite into it,

14:39.600 --> 14:41.660
your mouth is filled with a sweetness

14:41.790 --> 14:44.190
that lingers on your tongue for a long time.

14:46.630 --> 14:47.890
I also drank fine wine,

14:48.240 --> 14:49.640
watched foreign dances,

14:49.840 --> 14:51.840
toured Guangping's night scenery,

14:51.870 --> 14:53.080
and wandered through

14:53.100 --> 14:55.140
all the streets and alleys of Guangping City.

14:55.140 --> 14:56.320
Such a place of outstanding people and beautiful scenery,

14:56.320 --> 14:57.930
with picturesque landscapes

14:57.930 --> 14:59.600
and profound cultural heritage,

14:59.600 --> 15:02.000
deserves to be captured in a painting by me.

15:02.550 --> 15:04.550
So I moved into the Underground City

15:04.670 --> 15:07.000
to paint "A Spring Day in Guangping."

15:08.670 --> 15:10.030
I wanted to include the city's

15:10.030 --> 15:11.600
every blade of grass, every tree, every brick and tile,

15:11.600 --> 15:13.050
the city's people, and its famous landmarks.

15:13.050 --> 15:14.380
I wanted to paint it all.

15:15.510 --> 15:16.510
And this painting

15:18.000 --> 15:19.030
took 100 years.

15:22.360 --> 15:23.870
But when I reached The Six Wonders,

15:23.870 --> 15:24.650
I realized

15:25.480 --> 15:27.270
that I had thought too simply.

15:27.960 --> 15:29.150
No matter what I did,

15:29.150 --> 15:30.390
I couldn't capture

15:30.390 --> 15:32.720
the true essence and spirit of the people.

15:33.480 --> 15:35.480
Ink figures, after all, lack a mind.

15:36.020 --> 15:37.620
And that natural charm,

15:37.650 --> 15:39.250
that divine craftsmanship,

15:39.630 --> 15:41.840
was beyond my magical powers.

15:46.440 --> 15:47.150
So,

15:47.670 --> 15:48.390
you came up with the idea

15:48.390 --> 15:50.850
of putting living people into the painting.

15:55.720 --> 15:56.720
The tower keeper,

15:57.030 --> 15:58.240
the owner of the Tang Residence,

15:58.240 --> 15:58.970
Lord Xin'an,

15:59.600 --> 16:01.550
the young Taoist priest under the Matchmaking Tree,

16:01.550 --> 16:02.750
and Banxia's mother…

16:03.200 --> 16:05.130
You captured them all, didn't you?

16:06.270 --> 16:07.270
Some of them, yes.

16:07.440 --> 16:08.390
Some of them, no.

16:09.120 --> 16:10.790
Take Lord Xin'an

16:11.000 --> 16:11.790
for example.

16:12.550 --> 16:14.030
He was already a dying man.

16:14.760 --> 16:15.700
If it weren't for me,

16:15.700 --> 16:17.630
he would have become dust long ago.

16:18.320 --> 16:19.850
I granted him immortality,

16:20.360 --> 16:21.790
but he was ungrateful.

16:24.150 --> 16:26.080
Then why did you send Chi Wangchuan

16:26.080 --> 16:27.680
to capture Banxia's father?

16:30.150 --> 16:32.480
At that time, I was painting Fa'en Temple,

16:32.920 --> 16:34.360
but no matter how hard I tried,

16:34.360 --> 16:35.420
I couldn't capture

16:35.790 --> 16:38.380
the divine essence of the weeping Guanyin Bodhisattva.

16:38.380 --> 16:39.260
So I had to

16:39.290 --> 16:41.290
go out again to gather inspiration.

16:41.740 --> 16:42.650
As if by fate,

16:43.320 --> 16:45.240
I encountered Ms. Tang in the Underground City

16:45.240 --> 16:47.320
who was searching for her daughter.

16:49.670 --> 16:50.910
That Ms. Tang

16:51.390 --> 16:53.030
had such a sincere love for her daughter.

16:53.030 --> 16:54.760
It was deeply moving to behold.

16:55.790 --> 16:56.790
When she cried,

16:57.610 --> 16:59.360
she was identical to the Guanyin Bodhisattva

16:59.360 --> 17:00.510
I had imagined.

17:02.840 --> 17:05.069
But once the Guanyin Bodhisattva statue was completed,

17:05.069 --> 17:06.200
she stopped crying.

17:07.000 --> 17:08.670
I couldn't understand why.

17:09.240 --> 17:10.510
So I had to bring her out of the painting

17:10.510 --> 17:12.240
to have a proper talk with her.

17:12.920 --> 17:13.550
She

17:14.400 --> 17:15.240
pretended to

17:15.240 --> 17:16.230
write a poem

17:16.640 --> 17:18.240
to express her longing.

17:18.800 --> 17:19.920
Then, when I wasn't paying attention,

17:19.920 --> 17:21.480
she sent that poem out.

17:21.960 --> 17:23.560
It was precisely this letter

17:23.750 --> 17:24.750
that made me realize

17:24.750 --> 17:26.880
her deep love for her husband.

17:27.550 --> 17:28.590
So I thought

17:29.350 --> 17:31.310
that if I captured her husband too

17:31.340 --> 17:33.340
and placed him before her every day,

17:33.600 --> 17:34.720
they would be so close

17:34.720 --> 17:36.180
yet unable to be together.

17:36.590 --> 17:38.680
Wouldn't that make her cry?

17:41.720 --> 17:43.580
You really went to great lengths.

17:45.440 --> 17:47.640
I just wanted to create a good painting.

17:47.830 --> 17:49.890
There was no other malicious intent.

17:50.000 --> 17:51.260
What a fine statement!

17:58.590 --> 17:59.200
Do you know

17:59.200 --> 18:00.180
how many people's lives were ruined

18:00.180 --> 18:01.750
because of your one painting?

18:01.750 --> 18:02.880
I'll kill you today

18:02.900 --> 18:04.100
to avenge my parents.

18:11.030 --> 18:11.960
Are you alright?

18:12.070 --> 18:13.030
How can this be?

18:14.140 --> 18:15.640
He's the master of the painting.

18:15.640 --> 18:17.700
Nothing in the painting can harm him.

18:19.440 --> 18:21.100
How did she regain her memory?

18:22.810 --> 18:23.740
What did you do?

18:26.000 --> 18:26.940
What did I do?

18:27.570 --> 18:28.430
Don't you know?

18:30.420 --> 18:31.100
Could it be…

18:32.350 --> 18:35.150
Could it be that you already know the incantation?

18:35.750 --> 18:36.550
Incantation?

18:37.590 --> 18:39.250
Is that what you call the moon?

18:45.720 --> 18:47.000
Ancient divine beast?

18:47.620 --> 18:49.270
Stop flattering yourself.

18:50.030 --> 18:50.920
You're nothing but an

18:50.920 --> 18:51.640
ephemeral

18:52.160 --> 18:53.270
Moon-Fearing Bug, less significant

18:53.270 --> 18:54.070
than an ant.

18:54.070 --> 18:54.440
You—

18:56.780 --> 18:58.110
There is an ancient book

18:58.440 --> 19:00.240
called the Hundred Demon Catalog.

19:00.240 --> 19:01.840
I'm sure you haven't read it.

19:04.440 --> 19:05.720
The Moon-Fearing Bug

19:06.720 --> 19:07.720
has a sandy color

19:08.110 --> 19:09.310
and a turtle's shape.

19:09.590 --> 19:11.070
It lives on the north bank of Taiqi Mountain,

19:11.070 --> 19:12.440
in a place of sunlight and warmth.

19:12.440 --> 19:13.570
It fears moonlight.

19:13.720 --> 19:15.200
Exposure to it means death.

19:15.200 --> 19:17.000
That's why it's called Moon-Fearing.

19:17.000 --> 19:18.330
You must have been lucky

19:18.550 --> 19:20.160
to be born in the Underground City.

19:20.160 --> 19:21.550
That place is isolated from the outside world,

19:21.550 --> 19:23.010
with no sight of sun or moon.

19:23.010 --> 19:25.070
That's why you were fortunate enough to survive.

19:25.070 --> 19:25.790
Moreover,

19:26.440 --> 19:28.480
you were lucky to obtain a primordial spirit

19:28.480 --> 19:29.540
and become a demon.

19:31.510 --> 19:32.430
I, the honored one...

19:32.430 --> 19:33.270
I, the honored one...

19:33.270 --> 19:35.130
You keep saying "the honored one'

19:35.480 --> 19:36.550
but I'd like to ask,

19:36.920 --> 19:38.030
how are you honored?

19:38.030 --> 19:38.800
How dare you!

19:38.830 --> 19:39.590
Insolence!

19:40.920 --> 19:42.160
All the demons in this world

19:42.160 --> 19:43.200
obtained a primordial spirit

19:43.200 --> 19:44.180
by accident,

19:44.310 --> 19:45.750
which awakened their consciousness.

19:45.750 --> 19:47.000
There are no exceptions.

19:47.000 --> 19:47.880
You are not

19:47.880 --> 19:49.240
some innate spiritual being,

19:49.240 --> 19:51.240
nor are you an ancient divine beast.

19:51.510 --> 19:52.680
You're just a bug.

19:52.830 --> 19:53.680
I am not!

19:59.440 --> 20:00.590
You transformed into a demon

20:00.590 --> 20:01.790
and cultivated here.

20:02.160 --> 20:04.720
I'll give you credit for enduring the loneliness.

20:04.720 --> 20:05.390
Gradually,

20:05.960 --> 20:08.110
you finally mastered your magical arts.

20:08.110 --> 20:09.570
You went to Guangping City

20:10.110 --> 20:10.960
and saw beautiful scenery,

20:10.960 --> 20:12.500
other the pitch-black

20:12.530 --> 20:13.640
Underground City.

20:14.960 --> 20:17.030
You said you saw the night view of Guangping,

20:17.030 --> 20:18.000
but that's a lie,

20:18.850 --> 20:19.610
because you

20:19.640 --> 20:21.640
don't dare to look at the moon at all.

20:30.960 --> 20:32.240
Today is a full moon.

21:22.350 --> 21:23.270
Who gave you

21:23.270 --> 21:25.200
the lousy idea to paint Guangping?

21:25.230 --> 21:26.830
Was it your companion demon?

21:27.030 --> 21:28.000
Let me guess.

21:28.680 --> 21:31.280
Your painting skills improved, and by chance,

21:31.640 --> 21:33.590
you managed to infuse magical power into your painting,

21:33.590 --> 21:35.270
glimpsing the method of creating reality from illusion,

21:35.270 --> 21:37.160
the art of shaping a microcosm.

21:39.000 --> 21:39.830
In your eyes,

21:40.350 --> 21:42.800
nothing in the human world is more beautiful than Guangping.

21:42.800 --> 21:43.650
To have

21:43.680 --> 21:45.060
your own Guangping

21:45.510 --> 21:47.970
became an obsession you couldn't shake off.

21:48.880 --> 21:49.480
As a

21:49.480 --> 21:51.000
pitiful and cowardly bug,

21:51.400 --> 21:52.000
I believe

21:52.000 --> 21:53.480
you only needed one lesson

21:53.750 --> 21:55.820
to never dare venture to the surface again.

21:55.820 --> 21:56.340
So,

21:57.500 --> 21:59.480
someone toured Guangping on your behalf,

21:59.480 --> 22:00.160
inquired for you

22:00.160 --> 22:01.980
about the events of the past thousand years,

22:01.980 --> 22:03.290
and vividly depicted

22:03.480 --> 22:05.430
all sorts of people for you.

22:09.720 --> 22:11.030
Stop talking.

22:11.960 --> 22:12.830
Shut up.

22:13.330 --> 22:14.460
Be quiet!

22:14.830 --> 22:16.290
Are you angry out of shame?

22:17.240 --> 22:18.970
Which one infuriates you more?

22:19.400 --> 22:21.270
Is it that your lies have been exposed,

22:21.270 --> 22:22.880
or that your delusion of being powerful

22:22.880 --> 22:24.010
has been shattered?

22:28.160 --> 22:29.030
When you tell lies too often,

22:29.030 --> 22:30.880
you start to believe them yourself.

22:30.880 --> 22:32.350
What a pitiful bug.

22:34.400 --> 22:35.110
I

22:36.400 --> 22:37.440
am not.

22:38.640 --> 22:40.730
I'm not a pitiful bug.

22:45.350 --> 22:46.950
How did you figure it out?

22:48.310 --> 22:49.770
There were too many flaws.

22:50.400 --> 22:51.160
You wanted to paint

22:51.160 --> 22:53.270
a scroll of the most beautiful scenery in the world,

22:53.270 --> 22:55.000
yet there's no moon in your painting.

22:55.000 --> 22:56.260
In this painted world,

22:56.890 --> 22:57.720
the people you've captured

22:57.720 --> 22:59.050
never mention the moon,

22:59.750 --> 23:00.830
as if they don't even know

23:00.830 --> 23:02.760
that the moon exists in this world.

23:03.400 --> 23:04.200
Add to that Banxia

23:04.200 --> 23:05.860
and Lord Xin'an's awakening,

23:06.110 --> 23:07.110
and your identity

23:07.270 --> 23:08.670
was naturally revealed.

23:14.960 --> 23:15.590
Clever.

23:16.750 --> 23:18.310
Such a clever mind.

23:19.350 --> 23:21.280
But what can you do even if you know?

23:21.450 --> 23:23.300
This is the world I created.

23:23.790 --> 23:25.030
You can't harm me,

23:25.720 --> 23:27.000
nor can you escape.

23:34.240 --> 23:34.880
Xuanye,

23:36.510 --> 23:38.040
what happened to your hand?

23:39.510 --> 23:40.710
What did you do to him?

23:41.400 --> 23:43.120
I didn't do anything.

23:43.770 --> 23:45.010
You were the ones who first violated

23:45.010 --> 23:46.740
the rules of the painted world.

23:48.470 --> 23:49.930
It seems that before long,

23:50.400 --> 23:50.830
you will

23:50.830 --> 23:52.200
be like Lord Xin'an

23:52.920 --> 23:55.550
and be completely erased by the painted world.

23:57.110 --> 23:58.750
Your lies have been exposed.

23:59.240 --> 24:00.970
Won't you admit your mistakes?

24:01.960 --> 24:03.160
It's not too late now.

24:03.590 --> 24:05.050
If you release the others,

24:05.110 --> 24:06.270
I can spare your life.

24:06.270 --> 24:06.830
Release?

24:16.510 --> 24:17.200
Release?

24:18.070 --> 24:20.070
Where do you want me to release them?

24:21.640 --> 24:24.370
In this vast world of mortals, everyone suffers.

24:24.680 --> 24:26.160
What do you know?

24:27.110 --> 24:29.000
Humans are mere mortals.

24:29.790 --> 24:31.790
They only have a fleeting lifespan,

24:31.920 --> 24:33.110
like a white colt passing through a crack.

24:33.110 --> 24:34.680
It's only an instant.

24:34.920 --> 24:36.550
And even with just this instant,

24:36.550 --> 24:38.350
they can't enjoy it peacefully.

24:38.750 --> 24:40.190
They must seek food to fill their stomachs,

24:40.190 --> 24:42.260
and sew clothes to cover their bodies.

24:42.260 --> 24:43.730
They endure the difficulties of seven emotions and six desires,

24:43.730 --> 24:45.650
suffer the pains of birth, aging, sickness, and death.

24:45.650 --> 24:46.720
There's also hatred, separation,

24:46.720 --> 24:47.920
floods, wildfires,

24:48.400 --> 24:51.060
wars, and the oppression of the poor by the rich.

24:51.350 --> 24:52.480
But in my painting,

24:53.400 --> 24:54.930
this life has only this day.

24:55.840 --> 24:57.190
Day and night cycle endlessly,

24:57.190 --> 24:58.920
allowing everyone immortality.

24:58.920 --> 25:01.050
Joy is eternal, sorrow does not exist.

25:01.920 --> 25:03.270
There's no fear in life,

25:03.510 --> 25:04.790
no dread in death.

25:05.560 --> 25:07.720
The past is like an illusion and the future is eternal.

25:07.720 --> 25:08.470
Isn't this

25:08.490 --> 25:09.560
true liberation

25:09.590 --> 25:11.050
and the ultimate freedom?

25:14.590 --> 25:15.750
But this is all fake.

25:16.310 --> 25:17.240
What did you say?

25:18.200 --> 25:19.070
Fake?

25:28.830 --> 25:29.920
You... you...

25:30.310 --> 25:31.270
You tell me

25:31.830 --> 25:34.160
all of this is fake.

25:36.920 --> 25:38.280
Then tell me,

25:38.310 --> 25:39.550
what is real?

25:40.790 --> 25:42.200
How do you know that your world

25:42.200 --> 25:43.330
is definitely real?

25:44.550 --> 25:45.350
How do you know

25:45.350 --> 25:47.100
you're not a puppet on strings,

25:47.350 --> 25:49.030
not a clown on the stage?

25:49.700 --> 25:50.640
How do you know that everything about you

25:50.640 --> 25:51.500
isn't the moon in the water,

25:51.500 --> 25:52.640
isn't a flower in the mirror,

25:52.640 --> 25:54.850
isn't just the audience's

25:54.880 --> 25:56.680
casual joke after tea and meals?

26:06.480 --> 26:08.270
How can a clever person like you

26:08.290 --> 26:10.330
not understand

26:12.110 --> 26:15.710
there's no difference between inside and outside the painting?

26:16.070 --> 26:17.270
Real and fake,

26:17.510 --> 26:18.510
fake and real,

26:20.680 --> 26:23.160
it's all just a dream.

26:24.830 --> 26:26.550
You say these self-deceiving words

26:26.550 --> 26:27.790
so smoothly.

26:29.070 --> 26:30.030
All these years,

26:30.510 --> 26:31.640
you've been relying on these words

26:31.640 --> 26:33.300
to deceive yourself, haven't you?

26:33.300 --> 26:34.060
Kid,

26:36.440 --> 26:38.640
I originally wanted to spare your life,

26:38.680 --> 26:39.640
but since you've

26:39.640 --> 26:41.840
already seen through the incantation,

26:41.920 --> 26:43.960
I can't let you live anymore.

28:22.400 --> 28:23.310
What should we do?

28:23.310 --> 28:24.310
We can't kill him.

28:24.760 --> 28:25.440
We can.

28:31.960 --> 28:32.470
Look,

28:33.320 --> 28:34.520
the moon has come out.

28:52.720 --> 28:54.270
You've ruined my important business.

28:54.270 --> 28:55.240
I'm furious.

29:49.660 --> 29:50.270
The moon.

29:50.290 --> 29:50.920
The moon.

29:50.920 --> 29:52.320
Finally, we see the moon.

29:54.480 --> 29:55.540
It's so beautiful.

29:55.670 --> 29:56.530
It's so bright.

29:57.270 --> 29:58.470
It really is the moon.

30:22.070 --> 30:22.830
Madam.

30:31.160 --> 30:31.790
Ink.

30:32.920 --> 30:33.550
Ermao.

30:33.590 --> 30:34.640
Who's Ermao?

30:35.030 --> 30:36.000
I am Big Brother.

30:36.340 --> 30:37.070
Big Brother.

30:38.030 --> 30:38.990
Where is this?

30:42.490 --> 30:43.340
What is that?

30:44.270 --> 30:45.200
That's the moon.

30:46.030 --> 30:47.230
Beautiful, isn't it?

30:50.090 --> 30:51.420
How can the moon be here?

30:51.680 --> 30:52.160
You.

30:53.350 --> 30:54.880
Since sound can travel out,

30:55.310 --> 30:56.480
then scent can too.

30:57.110 --> 30:57.750
Moon Bugs

30:58.360 --> 30:59.890
really love lamb lung soup.

31:19.240 --> 31:19.920
This is

31:21.830 --> 31:22.680
the moon?

31:23.270 --> 31:24.350
It's so beautiful.

31:26.350 --> 31:27.630
It's truly beautiful.

31:30.790 --> 31:32.110
Sha!

31:34.410 --> 31:37.570
It's so beautiful.

31:52.330 --> 31:54.170
Little Bug!

32:28.890 --> 32:31.710
[Zi Kong]

32:43.720 --> 32:44.310
You need to go quickly.

32:44.310 --> 32:45.070
Don't worry about me.

32:45.070 --> 32:46.550
So what's your name?

32:46.790 --> 32:47.850
My name is Manying!

32:47.930 --> 32:48.600
Run!

33:29.750 --> 33:30.300
Master.

33:33.170 --> 33:34.430
Did you bring him back?

33:37.200 --> 33:37.750
No.

33:38.640 --> 33:40.830
I searched in the human world for 12 years,

33:40.830 --> 33:41.680
but I still couldn't find

33:41.680 --> 33:43.310
the whereabouts of the Second Prince.

33:43.310 --> 33:44.270
I believe

33:44.470 --> 33:45.470
the Second Prince

33:47.750 --> 33:48.950
must be dead already.

33:49.000 --> 33:50.200
That's not possible.

33:50.960 --> 33:51.680
Shao Li

33:52.270 --> 33:54.070
has been stained with his blood.

33:54.240 --> 33:55.100
If he were dead,

33:55.830 --> 33:57.960
this bloodstain would disappear.

34:02.890 --> 34:04.420
Give me the peach talisman.

34:06.510 --> 34:07.200
The peach talisman

34:07.200 --> 34:08.320
can only protect one person

34:08.320 --> 34:10.480
to cross the Two Realms Mountain and the Carefree River.

34:10.480 --> 34:11.030
Master,

34:11.440 --> 34:13.110
you can't bring the Second Prince back.

34:13.110 --> 34:14.510
The 12th year is coming.

34:15.110 --> 34:17.320
When the gate opens,

34:18.840 --> 34:20.480
I must bring him back

34:21.510 --> 34:22.639
before Father acts.

34:25.219 --> 34:27.949
What if the Second Prince doesn't want to return?

34:30.480 --> 34:32.340
I will definitely bring him back.

34:39.320 --> 34:40.570
Ordinary Moon-Fearing Bugs

34:40.570 --> 34:42.630
live and die in a day, as fleeting as mayflies.

34:42.630 --> 34:44.429
But this one was extraordinary.

34:44.449 --> 34:45.630
Xuanye said he had been hiding in the Underground City

34:45.630 --> 34:46.760
for over 100 years.

34:47.000 --> 34:47.880
The sun wasn't visible,

34:47.880 --> 34:49.190
so naturally, he couldn't see the moon either.

34:49.190 --> 34:50.510
That's why he didn't die.

34:50.510 --> 34:51.639
For his own benefit,

34:52.030 --> 34:54.090
he created a world within a painting.

34:54.170 --> 34:55.510
Every blade of grass and every tree there,

34:55.510 --> 34:56.550
every object and every person,

34:56.550 --> 34:57.360
all moved according to

34:57.360 --> 34:58.760
his thoughts and desires

34:58.800 --> 35:00.260
and they couldn't escape.

35:00.440 --> 35:01.880
Then, how were you able to escape?

35:01.880 --> 35:03.880
T-That's really incredible.

35:05.070 --> 35:05.840
Yes,

35:06.400 --> 35:08.060
it did take quite some effort.

35:08.890 --> 35:10.030
We faced several dangers

35:10.030 --> 35:11.490
and almost lost our lives.

35:13.440 --> 35:15.440
Fortunately, we eventually saw through the illusion

35:15.440 --> 35:16.840
and defeated that demon.

35:16.840 --> 35:18.760
This is truly such a twisted and strange tale.

35:18.760 --> 35:19.800
Who could have imagined

35:19.800 --> 35:21.320
that such a demon exists in this world?

35:21.320 --> 35:22.230
Indeed.

35:22.920 --> 35:24.400
If I hadn't experienced it myself,

35:24.400 --> 35:26.360
I wouldn't have believed it either.

35:26.360 --> 35:27.760
S-So what happened next?

35:28.110 --> 35:29.970
That demon was afraid of the moon.

35:30.300 --> 35:31.100
As soon as he saw,

35:31.100 --> 35:32.430
Xuanye's precious bugs,

35:32.430 --> 35:33.890
he vanished into thin air.

35:33.960 --> 35:34.750
Once he died,

35:34.840 --> 35:36.670
the painted world also collapsed.

35:36.670 --> 35:37.930
We, the living humans,

35:37.960 --> 35:39.150
regained our senses,

35:39.150 --> 35:40.560
and broke free from our restraints.

35:40.560 --> 35:41.710
The leaders of the Xiaodongtian

35:41.710 --> 35:42.590
also came forward

35:42.590 --> 35:45.250
and sent the trapped people back home one by one.

35:46.110 --> 35:47.240
Commissioner Sima,

35:47.440 --> 35:49.170
didn't you enter the painting?

35:53.920 --> 35:54.480
I didn't.

35:55.150 --> 35:56.920
That's really a pity.

35:57.840 --> 35:58.440
Yes,

35:58.850 --> 35:59.880
it's indeed a pity

35:59.910 --> 36:01.180
to not be part of

36:01.400 --> 36:02.400
such a rare event.

36:02.820 --> 36:03.500
Otherwise,

36:03.520 --> 36:04.670
I could have fought alongside Chief Constable Chu,

36:04.670 --> 36:05.880
and battled and vanquished

36:05.880 --> 36:07.010
the demon together.

36:08.320 --> 36:09.180
Don't say that.

36:09.720 --> 36:10.320
You contributed

36:10.320 --> 36:11.380
on the outside too.

36:11.400 --> 36:11.800
Yes.

36:14.590 --> 36:15.190
Tingzhou,

36:15.840 --> 36:16.840
where is your lady?

36:16.840 --> 36:18.300
She's on the second floor.

36:18.920 --> 36:19.780
Xuanye's room?

36:22.550 --> 36:24.010
Why isn't she coming down?

36:24.190 --> 36:25.070
I'll go find her.

36:25.070 --> 36:25.600
Sit down.

36:29.000 --> 36:30.190
Tell Chief Constable Wen properly

36:30.190 --> 36:31.250
how I contributed.

36:31.770 --> 36:32.710
Why should I do whatever

36:32.710 --> 36:33.360
you tell me to?

36:33.360 --> 36:35.020
Can't you speak for yourself?

36:35.920 --> 36:37.050
Not as well as you do.

36:37.320 --> 36:37.880
Say more.

36:37.960 --> 36:38.510
Say more.

36:40.510 --> 36:42.630
Commissioner Sima was looking for us outside,

36:42.630 --> 36:43.400
and by chance,

36:43.400 --> 36:44.530
she found that study

36:44.590 --> 36:45.710
and somehow,

36:46.230 --> 36:47.670
she killed that demon.

36:49.880 --> 36:50.540
That's all?

36:53.170 --> 36:54.370
I was in the painting.

36:54.680 --> 36:56.050
You can fill in the rest.

37:00.130 --> 37:01.130
Does it still fit?

37:02.320 --> 37:04.280
I feel like it's loose.

37:04.300 --> 37:06.560
Have you lost weight in the past few days?

37:06.920 --> 37:07.590
I haven't.

37:08.240 --> 37:09.810
No, look at the waist here,

37:10.230 --> 37:11.360
It's clearly loose.

37:12.000 --> 37:13.800
I just measured it a few days ago.

37:14.190 --> 37:15.990
Haven't you been eating lately?

37:16.360 --> 37:17.090
I have eaten.

37:19.920 --> 37:22.320
Your complexion doesn't look good either.

37:22.630 --> 37:23.830
It doesn't look good?

37:25.280 --> 37:27.400
Maybe I haven't been sleeping well lately.

37:27.400 --> 37:28.800
I've been dreaming a lot.

37:29.160 --> 37:30.290
What kind of dreams?

37:31.800 --> 37:33.260
I can't remember clearly.

37:35.070 --> 37:36.320
Take it off.

37:36.440 --> 37:37.280
I'll take it to the tailor

37:37.280 --> 37:38.610
for alterations later.

37:38.990 --> 37:39.620
No need.

37:39.650 --> 37:41.050
I think it's fine as it is.

37:41.280 --> 37:43.230
Besides, the fabric is very comfortable.

37:43.230 --> 37:43.830
Thank you.

37:44.400 --> 37:46.070
The fabric was chosen by my mother

37:46.070 --> 37:47.360
and I chose the style.

37:48.960 --> 37:50.020
It's all very good.

37:50.840 --> 37:51.500
Let me do it.

37:56.190 --> 37:56.840
Xuanye,

37:57.840 --> 37:58.640
what's wrong?

37:59.230 --> 38:00.810
Can this broken part

38:00.840 --> 38:02.030
be repaired?

38:03.090 --> 38:04.310
My father didn't teach me

38:04.310 --> 38:06.370
how to repair the Peerless Bracelet.

38:08.760 --> 38:09.670
My father left me this

38:09.670 --> 38:11.000
protective magic tool.

38:11.230 --> 38:11.960
I wanted it

38:11.960 --> 38:13.600
to stay by my side

38:13.630 --> 38:14.480
as a token.

38:15.190 --> 38:16.150
But I didn't expect

38:16.150 --> 38:17.280
that it took the Mirage Demon's hit

38:17.280 --> 38:18.440
in the painted world

38:18.760 --> 38:20.160
and was damaged a little.

38:20.750 --> 38:21.440
What a pity.

38:26.070 --> 38:27.510
Why are you all at my house instead of

38:27.510 --> 38:28.900
working in the government office?

38:28.900 --> 38:29.760
Youhuang was telling me

38:29.760 --> 38:31.480
about your experience in the Underground City.

38:31.480 --> 38:32.440
Xuanye, seriously.

38:32.440 --> 38:33.230
Why didn't you bring me

38:33.230 --> 38:34.360
for this adventure?

38:35.710 --> 38:37.400
I'll be returning to Shendu tomorrow.

38:37.400 --> 38:38.070
This afternoon,

38:38.070 --> 38:39.840
I've arranged a banquet at Yanlai Restaurant.

38:39.840 --> 38:41.150
I hope you all can attend.

38:41.150 --> 38:42.480
You're leaving so soon?

38:42.630 --> 38:43.590
How is it soon?

38:44.230 --> 38:45.150
It's been half a month

38:45.150 --> 38:46.290
since we came out of the Underground City.

38:46.290 --> 38:47.490
If I don't leave soon,

38:47.800 --> 38:49.800
she'll have to stay for the New Year.

38:52.510 --> 38:53.990
You seem quite resentful.

38:54.510 --> 38:55.220
What's wrong?

38:55.220 --> 38:57.280
You don't want me to stay here, do you?

38:57.400 --> 38:58.330
I wouldn't dare.

38:59.240 --> 39:00.110
The case of Lord Xin'an

39:00.110 --> 39:01.390
has been solved.

39:02.000 --> 39:02.710
Tell me,

39:03.130 --> 39:03.760
do you want to

39:03.760 --> 39:05.070
return to Shendu with me

39:05.070 --> 39:06.000
to claim credit?

39:06.920 --> 39:08.380
Thank you, Commissioner,

39:08.770 --> 39:10.900
but I'm just a humble Chief Constable.

39:11.070 --> 39:12.360
Solving this case

39:12.560 --> 39:14.550
was all thanks to your brilliant deductions

39:14.550 --> 39:15.440
and your wisdom and courage.

39:15.440 --> 39:16.360
This achievement

39:16.360 --> 39:17.820
is yours to claim, My Lord.

39:18.190 --> 39:19.320
I don't need to go.

39:21.710 --> 39:22.240
Alright.

39:22.440 --> 39:24.640
I'll head back to the office first then.

39:25.070 --> 39:26.400
See you this afternoon.

39:32.110 --> 39:33.510
I'll go back first.

39:44.150 --> 39:45.000
My Lady,

39:45.360 --> 39:46.220
this one looks nice.

39:46.220 --> 39:47.620
Choose this one, My Lady.

39:55.150 --> 39:55.960
My Lady,

39:57.510 --> 39:58.710
do you think

39:59.330 --> 40:00.290
Miss Sima

40:00.320 --> 40:01.850
likes Chief Constable Chu?

40:03.590 --> 40:05.120
How did you figure that out?

40:05.480 --> 40:06.610
It's quite obvious.

40:07.190 --> 40:08.710
The way she looks at him like how you look at

40:08.710 --> 40:09.570
Physician Jiu.

40:11.690 --> 40:12.330
Is that so?

40:15.170 --> 40:15.730
My Lady,

40:16.440 --> 40:17.480
you've all been back

40:17.480 --> 40:18.880
for over half a month now.

40:19.090 --> 40:19.790
Why hasn't Physician Jiu

40:19.790 --> 40:21.060
come to propose yet?

40:21.680 --> 40:23.290
Didn't you already tell Master

40:23.290 --> 40:26.650
that you want to break off the engagement with the Li family's son?

40:26.650 --> 40:28.440
Well, my parents were trapped in that painting

40:28.440 --> 40:29.480
for so long.

40:29.670 --> 40:31.320
They must be severely weakened.

40:31.320 --> 40:33.450
They need time to recover, don't they?

40:33.470 --> 40:35.870
There's still time to write a letter later.

40:35.990 --> 40:38.120
Xuanye went through so much this time.

40:38.190 --> 40:39.790
He also needs to recuperate.

40:42.150 --> 40:43.550
So, does that mean we

40:43.550 --> 40:45.550
we don't have to return to Yuanzhou?

40:47.540 --> 40:48.940
You don't want to return?

40:50.960 --> 40:52.890
Do you not want to return

40:52.920 --> 40:54.510
because if you do return,

40:54.630 --> 40:56.060
you won't be able to see Chi Xue anymore?

40:56.060 --> 40:58.590
What nonsense are you talking about, My Lady?

40:59.190 --> 41:00.670
Chi Xue is a demon.

41:01.170 --> 41:02.380
He's a rabbit.

41:02.910 --> 41:04.640
How can a human be with a rabbit?

41:04.640 --> 41:05.310
What's wrong with being a demon?

41:05.310 --> 41:06.100
What's wrong with being a rabbit?

41:06.100 --> 41:07.390
You look down on him?

41:07.960 --> 41:08.760
It's not that.

41:10.110 --> 41:12.440
Anyway, humans and demons are different.

41:12.710 --> 41:15.070
Humans and rabbits are even more different.

41:15.070 --> 41:16.190
If it were you,

41:16.550 --> 41:17.510
would you be willing to

41:17.510 --> 41:18.320
be with a demon?

41:18.320 --> 41:19.110
I would.

41:19.960 --> 41:20.960
You're bluffing.

41:22.190 --> 41:23.070
You're going to be

41:23.070 --> 41:24.600
with Physician Jiu anyway,

41:24.840 --> 41:26.440
so of course you can talk big.

41:28.550 --> 41:30.150
My Lady, are you going to choose or not?

41:30.150 --> 41:31.680
If not, I'll choose for you.

41:40.920 --> 41:46.800
[Moon Step]

41:50.510 --> 41:51.030
Mother.

41:57.960 --> 41:58.510
Banxia.

41:59.070 --> 42:00.230
Why are you in such a hurry to leave?

42:00.230 --> 42:01.360
Where are you going?

42:03.030 --> 42:04.510
Miss Sima from Shendu

42:04.510 --> 42:05.400
is going back.

42:05.590 --> 42:07.050
We're going to see her off.

42:08.050 --> 42:09.050
Is that the female

42:09.080 --> 42:11.210
Chief Constable from the government?

42:12.630 --> 42:13.840
Then come back early.

42:14.000 --> 42:15.200
Don't drink alcohol.

42:15.840 --> 42:16.440
Alright.

42:16.920 --> 42:18.180
I'll take my leave now.

42:30.630 --> 42:31.570
Every year during the Lantern Festival,

42:31.570 --> 42:32.470
the dragon boat race

42:32.470 --> 42:34.800
is crowded with people, drums and gongs resounding,

42:34.800 --> 42:35.400
It's so lively.

42:35.400 --> 42:35.860
Really.

42:35.880 --> 42:37.340
You came at the wrong time.

42:37.480 --> 42:39.110
Next time, let me know in advance.

42:39.110 --> 42:39.460
You two.

42:39.460 --> 42:39.820
I...

42:40.110 --> 42:41.040
Please, come in.

42:42.630 --> 42:43.090
Banxia.

42:44.710 --> 42:45.640
Why are you late?

42:47.120 --> 42:48.630
My Lady was changing clothes.

42:48.630 --> 42:49.920
It took her an hour.

42:53.400 --> 42:54.510
Sorry to keep everyone waiting.

42:54.510 --> 42:55.310
It's alright.

42:55.650 --> 42:56.710
Everyone is here now.

42:56.710 --> 42:57.550
Let's serve the food.

42:57.550 --> 42:58.410
Serve the food.

43:01.760 --> 43:03.290
For this trip to Guangping,

43:03.920 --> 43:05.510
I'm grateful for everyone's care.

43:05.510 --> 43:07.320
I'll be returning to Shendu tomorrow.

43:07.320 --> 43:09.250
I don't know when we'll meet again,

43:09.800 --> 43:11.000
so I've prepared this feast

43:11.000 --> 43:11.930
to thank you all.

43:13.150 --> 43:15.210
Commissioner Sima, you're too kind.

43:16.030 --> 43:17.550
Youhuang is my good friend.

43:17.550 --> 43:19.670
Physician Jiu, you can just call me Lingying.

43:19.670 --> 43:20.070
Right.

43:21.070 --> 43:22.130
Just good friends.

43:23.710 --> 43:25.480
Why haven't my pork ribs been served yet?

43:25.480 --> 43:26.070
Waiter!

43:26.280 --> 43:26.740
Waiter!

43:30.480 --> 43:30.990
Xuanye,

43:31.550 --> 43:33.080
can you help me ask about it?

43:46.990 --> 43:47.450
Banxia,

43:48.630 --> 43:49.490
have some fish.

43:49.590 --> 43:51.070
I've removed all the bones for you.
